      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>An unconscious death wish, more common in older vampires, triggered by direct confrontation with the character's own immortality (visiting a mortal descendant's grave, watching a ghoul die of old age).</p><p><strong>Trigger/Effect:</strong> A failed Willpower test sends the character on an unconscious, dangerous, Masquerade-risking errand for the rest of the scene that she will doggedly pursue and rationalize as safe.</p><p><em>Source: Clanbook: Malkavian, New Derangements.</em></p>",
